66. Explain commonly used Spring Boot annotations.

   1. @SpringBootApplication: Main application annotation combining configuration,
      component scanning and auto-configuration.
   2. @RestController: Defines a REST controller that returns response data.
   3. @Service and @Repository: Identify service and persistence-layer components.
